{"version":1,"content":"<p>哈囉喂劇場《鬼到盡頭》昨晚（10月31日）迎來第3場，同時是萬聖節特別場，不少入場觀眾花心思、扮鬼扮馬看騷。</p><p>一班演員於謝幕後，即換上其準備哈囉喂服飾再登場，潘紹聰化身籤筒、郭羡妮扮恐怖護士、許軼Day@COLLAR扮車厘龜，以及梁嘉進的耶穌扮相，較為突出。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.305453+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T06:21:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:19:05.456596+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"bd3dfdd3693b18a06819df210af862cfc690518c5e1aff38699ef807322b100d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}